span>: Yes, I'll be blogging!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I am putting in at least 60 hours at the restaurant this week. If I can keep that up, I'll have paid for almost half my trip by the end of the month.", "id": 1}, {"time": "29000", "image": "engenn9le14ob09re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I wish I could have gone with you guys but I have a plan.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You've been so elusive about your future. What's your plan?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: In five years, I'll have saved enough money to buy a house. Before that happens I'll have started my own PR company. Basically for the next two years I am going to spend as little money as possible.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That sounds reasonable. I will also stop squandering my money. It's going to be a challenge.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Money doesn't grow on trees! You have to keep an eye on your money.", "id": 2}, {"time": "60000", "image": "engenn9le14ob09re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I am starting a retirement fund as soon as I pay off the trip. I meet with someone at the bank tomorrow. It opens at 8:30 and I have the first appointment.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Good idea. I just hope I'm getting the best returns on my investments.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You guys will be fine. You're ahead of the game.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I don't know. I have friends who have already squirreled away enough savings to retire!", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}